{"unit_id":"HuanLinOTO__dsh-plugin-auto-blame#caveat-1","repo":"HuanLinOTO/dsh-plugin-auto-blame","commit":"7a51349548da0c1fffee5b893ec45f4f9fa9a54b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-blame 使用当前 agent 的模型提供方生成建议，提示内容包含最多最近三条对话消息；在生成建议时，这些消息会随请求交给该模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/blame-llm.ts:32-39","src/blame-llm.ts:161-180"]}
